WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.230 --> 00:00:01.130
- You might've been hearing

00:00:01.130 --> 00:00:03.900
that there are major changes
to copyright law coming

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:05.560
as a result of the new
appropriations bill.

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:07.520
And that's because it's true.

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:09.820
The new appropriations
bill has two main changes.

00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:13.340
One, it makes it a felony to
do certain kinds of streaming.

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:14.690
That's not that big of a change

00:00:14.690 --> 00:00:16.290
because lots of copyright infringement

00:00:16.290 --> 00:00:18.950
is considered a felony, it
just brings streaming in line

00:00:18.950 --> 00:00:20.920
with the rest of those infringements.

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:23.020
And the other is creating
small claims court

00:00:23.020 --> 00:00:24.170
for copyright law.

00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:25.090
This could go both ways

00:00:25.090 --> 00:00:26.900
with an uptick in copyright trolling

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:28.800
and people having to
pay as much as $30,000

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:30.160
plus attorney's fees.

00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:30.993
On the other hand,

00:00:30.993 --> 00:00:33.750
you might have smaller
creators getting remuneration

00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:36.150
for people using their
copyrighted material.

00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:37.200
I'm gonna have to think about this.

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:39.680
It's complicated and I'll
probably do a full video on it.

00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:40.730
But if it wants some holiday cheer,

00:00:40.730 --> 00:00:41.720
check out the video I did

00:00:41.720 --> 00:00:43.680
on all the law's broken
in "Christmas Vacation,"

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:45.423
and I'll see you in court.

